    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/68139cfd9fcc1696bfe16dde16946174.avif?t=1748592455\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is dying, and all you can do in this game is 'press the right-Arrow button'!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world using only 2 buttons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/846c51cce17d28aabc2583219bab1ca8.avif?t=1748592455\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you're a witch in a pocket.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naturally, there's not much you can do in this state!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can only use the right arrow key to 'teleport' forward or</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/178ba4161e1e5d0b5be7673c2fbf5daa.poster.avif?t=1748592455\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/178ba4161e1e5d0b5be7673c2fbf5daa.webm?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/178ba4161e1e5d0b5be7673c2fbf5daa.mp4?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>return with the 'R' button.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/a41a94447b1a8a854d469298bd6a6c20.poster.avif?t=1748592455\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/a41a94447b1a8a854d469298bd6a6c20.webm?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/a41a94447b1a8a854d469298bd6a6c20.mp4?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eh... that's it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sounds too easy, right? Well, why don't you give it a try?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/3ca77fb271e42cb9cf82d4eee9750f35.poster.avif?t=1748592455\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/3ca77fb271e42cb9cf82d4eee9750f35.webm?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/3ca77fb271e42cb9cf82d4eee9750f35.mp4?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It might be harder than you think!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can aim for a 'One Click' finish,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>or you can try to collect a variety of GameOvers!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help save the world in [Teleport Master]!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/68139cfd9fcc1696bfe16dde16946174.avif?t=1748592455\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is dying, and all you can do in this game is 'press the right-Arrow button'!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world using only 2 buttons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/846c51cce17d28aabc2583219bab1ca8.avif?t=1748592455\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you're a witch in a pocket.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naturally, there's not much you can do in this state!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can only use the right arrow key to 'teleport' forward or</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/178ba4161e1e5d0b5be7673c2fbf5daa.poster.avif?t=1748592455\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/178ba4161e1e5d0b5be7673c2fbf5daa.webm?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/178ba4161e1e5d0b5be7673c2fbf5daa.mp4?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>return with the 'R' button.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/a41a94447b1a8a854d469298bd6a6c20.poster.avif?t=1748592455\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/a41a94447b1a8a854d469298bd6a6c20.webm?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/a41a94447b1a8a854d469298bd6a6c20.mp4?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eh... that's it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sounds too easy, right? Well, why don't you give it a try?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/3ca77fb271e42cb9cf82d4eee9750f35.poster.avif?t=1748592455\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/3ca77fb271e42cb9cf82d4eee9750f35.webm?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/3ca77fb271e42cb9cf82d4eee9750f35.mp4?t=1748592455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It might be harder than you think!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can aim for a 'One Click' finish,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>or you can try to collect a variety of GameOvers!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help save the world in [Teleport Master]!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
